  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Electronic configuration for $\\operatorname{Cr}(24)$\r\n$=\\left[\\mathrm{Ar}]_{18} 4 s^{1} 3 d^{3}\\right.$\r\n$\\therefore 19^{\\text {b }}$ electron enters in $4 s$ -orbital and its set of quantum numbers is $n=4, l=0, m=0, m_{x}=+\\frac{1}{2}$",
    "image": null
  },
